  "readmeFile": "Readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "* Added cancellation-aware `PromptAsync(form, CancellationToken)` factories via `ICancellableSpectreFactory<T>`. Synchronous forms keep `Prompt` and now also implement `IAsyncSpectreFactory<T>` with both async overloads. Tokens flow through all prompt types, nested forms, collection confirmations and supported task-step parameters, with cancellation checks between steps. Existing async overloads, interface implementations and `AsyncSpectreFactoryBase<T>` subclasses remain compatible.\n      * Task steps now accept a `CancellationToken`, alone or alongside `IAnsiConsole` in either parameter order. Synchronous calls inject `CancellationToken.None`.\n      * Added a `net11.0` target alongside `net8.0` and `net10.0`. Building the package now requires .NET SDK 11 or later.",
